        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The_Justifier\" data-post=\"19\" data-topic=\"29272\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/48/4954_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> The_Justifier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It would be neat to have a more hacker-esque version of Parse, though.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Agreed. That does have potential, but one would have to make sure she’s different enough from garden-variety Parse.</p>",
